ThaiCluster.cpp contains a modified C++ port of the ordered Thai Character
Cluster grammar from PyThaiNLP:
https://github.com/PyThaiNLP/pythainlp/blob/4be114097e0cb1d9cfe044691f2aa79bc294925e/pythainlp/tokenize/tcc.py
